#37504
"Enormous Cavern"
"This huge cavern stretches in all directions, the walls and ceiling lost

in darkness.  A forest of stalagmites soars, stretching to meet

stalactites forty feet high.  Moisture drips from the ceiling like rain,

and from the east comes the sound of running water.  To the west, set in

the stone, is a narrow fissure leading back into the wall.

"
