north rises a massive stone wall, and to the east is a stone outcropping

that blocks movement in that direction.  To the west is a narrow tunnel

heading into the stone.  The air here is cold and still.  Rocks litter

the ground and rubble falls in clumps from crevices on the wall.  To the

south, the cavern stretches off into the darkness.

